			"Message": "perf(Sky): Consolidate CSS and JS chunks for bundled workbench\n\nDisable CSS code-splitting to emit a single CSS file per entry instead of ~75 individual `_astro/*.css` chunks. Add `manualChunks` to fold all VS Code modules reachable from the bundled workbench entry into one `workbench-[hash].js` file instead of ~60 separate chunks.\n\nThis reduces HTTP request waterfalling at runtime — the workbench now fetches a single JS asset and a single CSS asset rather than dozens of sequential requests.",
			"SHA": "c56f2637aa475f2fbcbf6e4769f6d49c36d0417e"
		},
